Pwnagotchi HGSEC includes an adapted Pwnagotchi LCD display implementation
extracted from the reference device. Pwnagotchi is attributed by the installed
package to evilsocket and the development team, with Jayofelony listed as a
maintainer. The installed package distributed GNU GPL version 3 license text;
see LICENSE. The original project is https://pwnagotchi.ai/.

The Waveshare 1.3-inch LCD HAT is hardware by Waveshare. Its hardware pinout
informs the GPIO mapping. This repository does not include its vendor driver;
the LCD adaptation relies on the driver included in the installed Pwnagotchi.
